# Docker ignore patterns are anchored at the build context root and do not
# recurse on their own — `node_modules` would only match /node_modules. Since
# the tree moved under apps/web, every path that can appear more than once in
# the workspace is written `**/`.
**/node_modules
**/.output
**/.nitro
**/.tanstack
data
.git
.env
.env.*
*.md
!README.md
packages/db/drizzle/**/*.snapshot.json
.vscode
.impeccable
